<title>USA: Battery Park City Authority $79.8 mln priced.</title>
<headline>Battery Park City Authority $79.8 mln priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said it</p>
<p>priced a $79.8 million Battery Park City Authority junior</p>
<p>revenue bond issue, Series 1996A, with a top yield of 5.875</p>
<p>percent in 2029.</p>
<p>The bonds are AMBAC insured.</p>
